msgid ""
"\n"
"              I have read and agree to the\n"
"              <a href=\"%(terms_link)s\" target=\"_blank\"\n"
"                 class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\"\n"
"                 onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>\n"
"              and the\n"
"              <a href=\"%(privacy_link)s\" target=\"_blank\"\n"
"                 class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\"\n"
"                 onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">Privacy Policy</a>\n"
"              of the IPT Marketplace.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"              Nimesoma na nakubaliana na\n"
"              <a href=\"%(terms_link)s\" target=\"_blank\"\n"
"                 class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\"\n"
"                 onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">Masharti na Vigezo</a>\n"
"              na\n"
"              <a href=\"%(privacy_link)s\" target=\"_blank\"\n"
"                 class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\"\n"
"                 onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">Sera ya Faragha</a>\n"
"              ya IPT Marketplace.\n"
"            "

msgid ""
"\n"
"            A student may cancel a pending application at any point <strong>strictly before</strong>\n"
"            the organization issues a formal approval, by clicking \"Cancel Application\" in their\n"
"            dashboard.  A confirmation modal will be displayed before the action is finalised.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Mwanafunzi anaweza kughairi ombi linalosubiri wakati wowote <strong>kabla kabisa</strong> shirika halijatoa idhini rasmi, kwa kubofya \"Ghairi Ombi\" kwenye dashibodi yake. Dirisha la uthibitisho litaonyeshwa kabla ya kitendo kukamilishwa.\n"
"          "

msgid ""
"\n"
"            All processing and platform fees paid by students are <strong>strictly non-refundable</strong>.\n"
"            By completing a transaction, the student irrevocably acknowledges that they are not\n"
"            entitled to a refund under any circumstances, including but not limited to:\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Ada zote za uchakataji na za jukwaa zinazolipwa na wanafunzi <strong>hazirudishwi kabisa</strong>. Kwa kukamilisha muamala, mwanafunzi anakiri bila kurejea nyuma kuwa hana haki ya kurejeshewa pesa katika hali yoyote, ikiwa ni pamoja na, lakini bila kikomo:\n"
"          "

msgid ""
"\n"
"            As platform fees are non-refundable, cancellation does not trigger any financial\n"
"            reimbursement.  Instead, the student's payment remains valid as a one-time\n"
"            <strong>Application Credit</strong>, entitling them to select and apply for an\n"
"            alternate available slot within the active academic placement period.\n"
"            <br><br>\n"
"            <strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> Students are strictly limited to one (1) cancellation per application fee. If a student cancels and uses their credit for an alternate slot, that second application is final and cannot be cancelled.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Kwa kuwa ada za jukwaa hazirudishwi, kughairi hakusababishi urejeshaji wowote wa fedha. Badala yake, malipo ya mwanafunzi yanaendelea kuwa halali kama <strong>Nafasi ya Kuomba Tena</strong> ya mara moja, inayomruhusu kuchagua na kuomba nafasi nyingine iliyopo ndani ya kipindi hai cha uwekaji wa kitaaluma. <br><br> <strong>MUHIMU:</strong> Wanafunzi wanaruhusiwa kughairi mara moja (1) tu kwa kila ada ya maombi. Mwanafunzi akighairi na kutumia nafasi yake ya kuomba tena kwa nafasi nyingine, ombi hilo la pili ni la mwisho na haliwezi kughairiwa.\n"
"          "

msgid ""
"\n"
"            Instead, an eligible fee converts to an <strong>Application Credit</strong> that entitles\n"
"            the student to select an alternate slot within the active academic placement period\n"
"            (see Section 7).\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Badala yake, ada inayostahili hubadilishwa kuwa <strong>Nafasi ya Kuomba Tena (Application Credit)</strong> inayomruhusu mwanafunzi kuchagua nafasi nyingine ndani ya kipindi hai cha uwekaji wa kitaaluma (tazama Sehemu ya 7).\n"
"          "

msgid ""
"\n"
"            The designated slot is immediately relinquished and returned to the public directory\n"
"            for other applicants, preventing vacancy hoarding.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Nafasi husika huachiliwa mara moja na kurudishwa kwenye orodha ya umma kwa waombaji wengine, kuzuia kujilimbikizia nafasi.\n"
"          "

msgid ""
"\n"
"            Upon cancellation, the system immediately transmits an electronic notice to both the\n"
"            organization (whose slot has been returned) and the Platform administrators.  This serves\n"
"            as verifiable proof of withdrawal under the <em>Electronic Transactions Act, Cap. 442</em>.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Baada ya kughairi, mfumo hutuma mara moja taarifa ya kielektroniki kwa shirika (ambalo nafasi yake imerudishwa) na kwa wasimamizi wa Jukwaa. Hii ni ushahidi unaothibitika wa kujiondoa chini ya <em>Sheria ya Miamala ya Kielektroniki, Sura ya 442</em>.\n"
"          "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          <strong>9.5 Delivery Delays:</strong>  SMS and in-app notifications are dispatched via an\n"
"          asynchronous background queue (Celery/Redis).  Semauya Limited is not liable for delayed\n"
"          or undelivered messages caused by mobile network operator outages, third-party gateway\n"
"          failures, or periods of high platform traffic.  Users should not rely solely on SMS\n"
"          notifications for time-sensitive placement decisions and should check their dashboard\n"
"          regularly.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          <strong>9.5 Ucheleweshaji wa Uwasilishaji:</strong> SMS na arifa za ndani ya programu hutumwa kupitia foleni ya nyuma isiyo ya papo hapo (Celery/Redis). Semauya Limited haina dhima kwa jumbe zilizochelewa au zisizowasilishwa zinazotokana na kukatika kwa waendeshaji wa mitandao ya simu, hitilafu za lango la wahusika wengine, au vipindi vya msongamano mkubwa wa jukwaa. Watumiaji hawapaswi kutegemea arifa za SMS pekee kwa maamuzi ya uwekaji yenye muda maalum na wanapaswa kukagua dashibodi yao mara kwa mara.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          <strong>Post-Approval Lock:</strong> Once an organization approves an application, the\n"
"          cancellation mechanism is permanently disabled for that slot.  No further\n"
"          changes or cancellations will be accepted under any circumstances.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          <strong>Kufungwa Baada ya Idhini:</strong> Shirika likishaidhinisha ombi, utaratibu wa kughairi huzimwa kabisa kwa nafasi hiyo. Hakuna mabadiliko au kughairi zaidi kutakakokubaliwa katika hali yoyote.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          <strong>Students</strong> must update their academic information (course, year of study,\n"
"          GPA, and institution) immediately upon any change.  <strong>Organizations</strong> must keep\n"
"          their registration details, contact information, and slot listings current and accurate.\n"
"          Profile information provided on the Platform may be relied upon by institutions, organizations,\n"
"          and administrators to make binding placement decisions.  Providing false or misleading\n"
"          information constitutes a violation of these Terms and the PDPA.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          <strong>Wanafunzi</strong> lazima wasasishe taarifa zao za kitaaluma (kozi, mwaka wa masomo, GPA na taasisi) mara moja kunapotokea mabadiliko yoyote. <strong>Mashirika</strong> lazima yaweke taarifa za usajili, mawasiliano na orodha za nafasi kuwa za kisasa na sahihi. Taarifa za wasifu zilizotolewa kwenye Jukwaa zinaweza kutegemewa na taasisi, mashirika na wasimamizi kufanya maamuzi ya uwekaji yanayofunga. Kutoa taarifa za uongo au za kupotosha ni ukiukaji wa Masharti haya na PDPA.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          <strong>Your PDPA rights:</strong> You have the right to access, correct, and request the\n"
"          deletion of your personal data.  To exercise these rights, contact us at\n"
"          <strong>privacy@semauya.co.tz</strong>.  We will respond within 21 days as required by law.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          <strong>Haki zako za PDPA:</strong> Una haki ya kufikia, kusahihisha na kuomba kufutwa kwa taarifa zako binafsi. Ili kutumia haki hizi, wasiliana nasi kupitia <strong>privacy@semauya.co.tz</strong>. Tutajibu ndani ya siku 21 kama sheria inavyotaka.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          A transaction is only deemed <strong>successful and complete</strong> upon receipt of a\n"
"          final digital confirmation from the mobile money provider via our payment gateway.\n"
"          Initiating a transfer does not constitute payment.  Applications are activated only after\n"
"          confirmed settlement.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Muamala huchukuliwa kuwa <strong>umefanikiwa na kukamilika</strong> tu baada ya kupokea uthibitisho wa mwisho wa kidijitali kutoka kwa mtoa huduma wa pesa za simu kupitia lango letu la malipo. Kuanzisha uhamishaji si malipo. Maombi huwashwa tu baada ya malipo kuthibitishwa.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          All SMS communications are dispatched through the Beem Africa SMS gateway using an\n"
"          alphanumeric Sender ID registered with the Tanzania Communications Regulatory Authority\n"
"          (TCRA) and approved by local network operators, in compliance with TCRA regulations.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          SMS zote hutumwa kupitia lango la SMS la Beem Africa kwa kutumia Kitambulisho cha Mtumaji cha herufi na namba kilichosajiliwa na Mamlaka ya Udhibiti wa Mawasiliano Tanzania (TCRA) na kuidhinishwa na waendeshaji wa mitandao wa ndani, kwa kufuata kanuni za TCRA.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          All platform fees are processed exclusively via approved electronic payment channels\n"
"          — M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa, and Airtel Money — in full compliance with the\n"
"          <em>Electronic Transactions (Mandatory Electronic Payments for Specified Transactions)\n"
"          Order, 2026</em>.  Cash payments are not accepted.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Ada zote za jukwaa huchakatwa kupitia njia zilizoidhinishwa za malipo ya kielektroniki pekee — M-Pesa, Tigo Pesa na Airtel Money — kwa kufuata kikamilifu <em>Amri ya Miamala ya Kielektroniki (Malipo ya Lazima ya Kielektroniki kwa Miamala Maalum), 2026</em>. Malipo ya fedha taslimu hayakubaliwi.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          An approved placement slot cannot be transferred to another student under any circumstances.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Nafasi ya uwekaji iliyoidhinishwa haiwezi kuhamishiwa mwanafunzi mwingine katika hali yoyote.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          By registering on the Platform, you consent to receive electronic communications —\n"
"          including in-app notifications and <strong>SMS alerts</strong> — necessary for platform\n"
"          functionality in accordance with the <em>Personal Data Protection Act, 2022</em> and the\n"
"          <em>Electronic and Postal Communications Act (EPOCA)</em>.  These include application\n"
"          status updates, payment confirmations, slot approval/rejection notices, and security alerts.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Kwa kujisajili kwenye Jukwaa, unakubali kupokea mawasiliano ya kielektroniki — ikiwa ni pamoja na arifa za ndani ya programu na <strong>tahadhari za SMS</strong> — yanayohitajika kwa utendaji wa jukwaa kwa mujibu wa <em>Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Taarifa Binafsi, 2022</em> na <em>Sheria ya Mawasiliano ya Kielektroniki na Posta (EPOCA)</em>. Hizi zinajumuisha masasisho ya hali ya ombi, uthibitisho wa malipo, taarifa za idhini/kukataliwa kwa nafasi, na tahadhari za usalama.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          By registering, you consent to your data being shared with prospective employers and\n"
"          educational institutions <strong>strictly for placement facilitation purposes</strong>.\n"
"          This includes sharing your verified academic profile, uploaded documents, and contact\n"
"          details with organizations that you apply to.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Kwa kujisajili, unakubali data yako ishirikiwe na waajiri watarajiwa na taasisi za elimu <strong>kwa madhumuni ya kuwezesha uwekaji pekee</strong>. Hii inajumuisha kushiriki wasifu wako wa kitaaluma uliothibitishwa, nyaraka ulizopakia na taarifa za mawasiliano na mashirika unayoyaomba.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          In accordance with the <em>Personal Data Protection Act, 2022</em> (PDPA), all Students and\n"
"          Organizations must provide <strong>complete, accurate, and up-to-date</strong> information\n"
"          upon registration and throughout their use of the Platform.  You are strictly required\n"
"          to update your profile immediately if any academic, personal, or corporate details change.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Kwa mujibu wa <em>Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Taarifa Binafsi, 2022</em> (PDPA), Wanafunzi na Mashirika wote lazima watoe taarifa <strong>kamili, sahihi na za kisasa</strong> wakati wa usajili na katika kipindi chote cha kutumia Jukwaa. Unatakiwa kabisa kusasisha wasifu wako mara moja ikiwa taarifa zozote za kitaaluma, binafsi au za kampuni zitabadilika.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          In the event of a <strong>failed or duplicate mobile money transaction</strong>, the student\n"
"          must report the issue to <strong>support@semauya.co.tz</strong> within 48 hours, providing\n"
"          the transaction reference number.  We will investigate and, where a confirmed duplicate\n"
"          charge is verified, initiate a reversal within <strong>14 business days</strong>.  Mobile\n"
"          network downtime does not entitle a student to a placement slot until confirmed settlement\n"
"          is received.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Katika tukio la <strong>muamala wa pesa za simu ulioshindwa au kurudiwa</strong>, mwanafunzi lazima aripoti tatizo kwa <strong>support@semauya.co.tz</strong> ndani ya saa 48, akitoa namba ya rejeo ya muamala. Tutachunguza na, pale makato yaliyorudiwa yatakapothibitishwa, tutaanzisha urejeshaji ndani ya <strong>siku 14 za kazi</strong>. Kukatika kwa mtandao wa simu hakumpi mwanafunzi haki ya nafasi ya uwekaji hadi malipo yathibitishwe.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Mobile money transaction data (reference number, amount, mobile number, timestamp)\n"
"          is processed to confirm payment and issue digital receipts.  This data is retained\n"
"          for financial audit purposes as required by Tanzanian law.  We do not store your\n"
"          full mobile money PIN or bank account credentials.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Data ya miamala ya pesa za simu (namba ya rejeo, kiasi, namba ya simu, muda) huchakatwa ili kuthibitisha malipo na kutoa risiti za kidijitali. Data hii huhifadhiwa kwa madhumuni ya ukaguzi wa kifedha kama sheria za Tanzania zinavyotaka. Hatuhifadhi PIN yako kamili ya pesa za simu wala taarifa za akaunti yako ya benki.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Mobile money transfers are subject to standard network-operator processing charges and the\n"
"          Government's <strong>Electronic Money Transaction Levy</strong>.  These additional charges\n"
"          are borne by the user (student) and are separate from the Platform fee.  The Platform fee\n"
"          displayed at checkout represents the amount due to Semauya Limited and does not include\n"
"          operator levies.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Uhamishaji wa pesa za simu unategemea ada za kawaida za uchakataji za mtoa huduma wa mtandao na <strong>Tozo ya Miamala ya Fedha za Kielektroniki</strong> ya Serikali. Gharama hizi za ziada hubebwa na mtumiaji (mwanafunzi) na ni tofauti na ada ya Jukwaa. Ada ya Jukwaa inayoonyeshwa wakati wa kulipa ni kiasi kinachodaiwa na Semauya Limited na haijumuishi tozo za watoa huduma.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Once an organization registers an official approval in the system, the slot assignment is\n"
"          <strong>final and binding</strong>.  The student's cancellation mechanism is permanently\n"
"          disabled for that application.  No slot changes, swaps, or reassignment requests will be\n"
"          accepted after approval.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Shirika likishasajili idhini rasmi kwenye mfumo, ugawaji wa nafasi huwa <strong>wa mwisho na wa kufunga</strong>. Utaratibu wa mwanafunzi wa kughairi huzimwa kabisa kwa ombi hilo. Hakuna maombi ya kubadilisha, kubadilishana au kupangiwa upya nafasi yatakayokubaliwa baada ya idhini.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Once the 24-hour period expires, the student's right to independently cancel\n"
"          is suspended.  The organization is then authorised to issue a final approval or rejection\n"
"          at their discretion.  Organizations are encouraged to review all pending applications\n"
"          promptly to avoid unnecessary slot unavailability.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Kipindi cha saa 24 kikishaisha, haki ya mwanafunzi ya kughairi mwenyewe husimamishwa. Shirika kisha linaruhusiwa kutoa idhini ya mwisho au kukataa kwa hiari yake. Mashirika yanahimizwa kupitia maombi yote yanayosubiri haraka ili kuepuka kutopatikana kwa nafasi bila sababu.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Organizations are restricted from approving or rejecting an application until exactly\n"
"          <strong>24 hours</strong> have elapsed from the time of submission.  The approval and\n"
"          rejection controls remain disabled within this window.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Mashirika yamezuiwa kuidhinisha au kukataa ombi hadi <strong>saa 24</strong> kamili zipite tangu wakati wa kuwasilisha. Vitufe vya kuidhinisha na kukataa vinabaki vimezimwa ndani ya dirisha hili.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Organizations that fail to review applications within a reasonable time after the\n"
"          cooling-off window may impact the student's academic timeline.  Semauya Limited\n"
"          reserves the right to follow up with organizations and, in extreme cases of inactivity,\n"
"          intervene to protect student interests.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Mashirika yasiyopitia maombi ndani ya muda unaofaa baada ya dirisha la kusubiri yanaweza kuathiri ratiba ya kitaaluma ya mwanafunzi. Semauya Limited ina haki ya kufuatilia mashirika na, katika hali kali za kutochukua hatua, kuingilia kati kulinda maslahi ya wanafunzi.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Providing misleading, false, or outdated information is a direct violation of these Terms\n"
"          and may result in immediate <strong>account suspension or permanent ban</strong>, forfeiture\n"
"          of any pending application credit, and referral to the relevant regulatory or law-enforcement\n"
"          authority.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Kutoa taarifa za kupotosha, za uongo au zilizopitwa na wakati ni ukiukaji wa moja kwa moja wa Masharti haya na kunaweza kusababisha <strong>kusimamishwa kwa akaunti au kupigwa marufuku kabisa</strong>, kupoteza nafasi yoyote ya kuomba tena inayosubiri, na kupelekwa kwa mamlaka husika ya udhibiti au ya vyombo vya sheria.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Pursuant to the <em>Employment and Labour Relations Act, 2004</em>, an IPT placement\n"
"          facilitated through this Platform constitutes an <strong>academic training arrangement</strong>\n"
"          only and does <strong>not</strong> create an employer-employee relationship, an employment\n"
"          contract, or any entitlement to wages, benefits, or statutory protections afforded to\n"
"          employees under Tanzanian labour law, unless separately agreed in writing between the student\n"
"          and the organization.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Kwa mujibu wa <em>Sheria ya Ajira na Mahusiano Kazini, 2004</em>, uwekaji wa IPT unaowezeshwa kupitia Jukwaa hili ni <strong>mpango wa mafunzo ya kitaaluma</strong> tu na <strong>haujengi</strong> uhusiano wa mwajiri na mwajiriwa, mkataba wa ajira, wala haki yoyote ya mishahara, marupurupu au ulinzi wa kisheria wanaopewa waajiriwa chini ya sheria za kazi za Tanzania, isipokuwa kama imekubaliwa vinginevyo kwa maandishi kati ya mwanafunzi na shirika.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Students retain the unrestricted right to cancel their application at any point\n"
"          during this 24-hour window, triggering the process described in Section 7.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Wanafunzi wanabaki na haki isiyozuiliwa ya kughairi ombi lao wakati wowote ndani ya dirisha hili la saa 24, jambo linalozindua mchakato ulioelezwa katika Sehemu ya 7.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          The PDPA 2022 legally mandates that data controllers take reasonable steps to ensure\n"
"          collected personal data is <strong>complete, accurate, relevant, and up to date</strong>.\n"
"          By accepting these terms, you acknowledge that you bear the primary responsibility\n"
"          to maintain the accuracy of your profile information at all times.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          PDPA 2022 inawataka kisheria wasimamizi wa data kuchukua hatua stahiki kuhakikisha taarifa binafsi zilizokusanywa ni <strong>kamili, sahihi, zinazohusika na za kisasa</strong>. Kwa kukubali masharti haya, unakiri kuwa una wajibu wa msingi wa kuhakikisha usahihi wa taarifa za wasifu wako wakati wote.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          The selected slot is immediately and exclusively reserved for the applicant.\n"
"          No other student may apply for that specific vacancy during the 24-hour cooling-off\n"
"          period defined in Section 8.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Nafasi iliyochaguliwa huhifadhiwa mara moja na kwa upekee kwa mwombaji. Hakuna mwanafunzi mwingine anayeweza kuomba nafasi hiyo mahususi wakati wa kipindi cha saa 24 cha kusubiri kilichoainishwa katika Sehemu ya 8.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          The slot is temporarily reserved for the applicant during the 24-hour period.\n"
"          Other students cannot apply for the same vacancy until the hold expires or the\n"
"          student cancels.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Nafasi huhifadhiwa kwa muda kwa mwombaji katika kipindi cha saa 24. Wanafunzi wengine hawawezi kuomba nafasi hiyo hiyo hadi muda wa kushikilia uishe au mwanafunzi aghairi.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          This rule exists under the principles of the <em>Fair Competition Act, 2003</em> to prevent\n"
"          slot hoarding, protect organizations from last-minute abandonment, and maintain platform integrity.\n"
"          Students are strongly advised to verify their choice before completing payment.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Sheria hii ipo chini ya kanuni za <em>Sheria ya Ushindani wa Haki, 2003</em> ili kuzuia kujilimbikizia nafasi, kulinda mashirika dhidi ya kuachwa dakika za mwisho, na kudumisha uadilifu wa jukwaa. Wanafunzi wanashauriwa sana kuthibitisha chaguo lao kabla ya kukamilisha malipo.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          To exercise any of the above rights, email <strong>privacy@semauya.co.tz</strong>\n"
"          with the subject line \"PDPA Rights Request\" and your account email address.\n"
"          We will respond within <strong>21 days</strong> as required by the PDPA.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Ili kutumia haki zozote zilizo hapo juu, tuma barua pepe kwa <strong>privacy@semauya.co.tz</strong> ukiwa na kichwa cha habari \"Ombi la Haki za PDPA\" na barua pepe ya akaunti yako. Tutajibu ndani ya <strong>siku 21</strong> kama PDPA inavyotaka.\n"
"        "

msgid ""
"\n"
"          Under the <em>Cybercrimes Act, 2015</em> and the EPOCA Online Content Regulations, 2020,\n"
