msgstr "Hujawahi kuomba nafasi yoyote."

msgid "You haven't posted any training opportunities. Create your first slot to start receiving applications."
msgstr "Hujatangaza nafasi yoyote ya mafunzo. Unda nafasi yako ya kwanza ianzishe kupokea maombi."

