msgstr "Hujapakia nyaraka yoyote. Tumia fomu upande wa kushoto kuanza kujenga hifadhi yako."

msgid "You must accept the Terms & Conditions to create an account."
msgstr "Lazima ukubali Masharti na Vigezo ili kufungua akaunti."

msgid "You must accurately state the number of available slots, location, department requirements, and stipend terms."
msgstr "Lazima ueleze kwa usahihi idadi ya nafasi zilizopo, eneo, mahitaji ya idara na masharti ya posho."

msgid "You must be a legally registered entity in Tanzania and upload valid BRELA certificate, TIN, and business license."
msgstr "Lazima uwe taasisi iliyosajiliwa kisheria nchini Tanzania na upakie cheti halali cha BRELA, TIN na leseni ya biashara."

msgid "You must be actively enrolled in an accredited Tanzanian university or technical institution."
msgstr "Lazima uwe umeandikishwa kikamilifu katika chuo kikuu au taasisi ya ufundi iliyoidhinishwa ya Tanzania."

msgid "You must not impersonate another student or submit forged documents."
msgstr "Hupaswi kujifanya mwanafunzi mwingine wala kuwasilisha nyaraka za kughushi."

msgid "You must provide truthful academic information (university, course, year of study, GPA) and upload genuine supporting documents."
msgstr "Lazima utoe taarifa za kitaaluma za kweli (chuo, kozi, mwaka wa masomo, GPA) na upakie nyaraka halisi za kuunga mkono."

msgid "You need a verified phone number before you can apply. It takes one SMS code."
msgstr "Unahitaji namba ya simu iliyothibitishwa kabla ya kuomba. Inahitaji msimbo mmoja wa SMS."

msgid "You pay a one-time application fee of <strong>TZS %(fee)s</strong> by mobile money. The organization only sees your application after you have paid."
msgstr "Unalipa ada ya maombi ya mara moja ya <strong>TZS %(fee)s</strong> kwa pesa za simu. Shirika huona ombi lako tu baada ya kulipa."

msgid "You rated them %(rating)s/5. You can update your review at any time."
msgstr "Umewakadiria %(rating)s/5. Unaweza kusasisha maoni yako wakati wowote."

msgid "You signed in with a temporary password. Replace it with a password only you know before continuing. The temporary password stops working once you do."
msgstr "Uliingia kwa nenosiri la muda. Libadilishe kwa nenosiri unalolijua wewe pekee kabla ya kuendelea. Nenosiri la muda litaacha kufanya kazi ukishafanya hivyo."

msgid "You were signed out because your account signed in on another device."
msgstr "Umetolewa kwa sababu akaunti yako iliingia kwenye kifaa kingine."

msgid "You will be logged out immediately and will not be able to log back in."
msgstr "Utatolewa mara moja na hutaweza kuingia tena."

msgid "Your %(kind)s was verified and updated."
msgstr "%(kind)s yako imethibitishwa na kusasishwa."

