msgstr "Ombi lako la kufuta akaunti limepokelewa. Akaunti yako sasa imezimwa na itafutwa kwa mujibu wa PDPA."

msgid "Your account is active — keep your details up to date."
msgstr "Akaunti yako ni hai — weka taarifa zako zilizosasa."

msgid "Your account will be deactivated immediately upon confirmation."
msgstr "Akaunti yako itazimwa mara tu utakapothibitisha."

msgid "Your company is"
msgstr "Kampuni yako ni"

