msgid ""
"Your phone number is shared with our registered SMS gateway (Beem Africa)\n"
"        solely to deliver system notifications."
msgstr "Namba yako ya simu inashirikishwa na lango letu la SMS lililosajiliwa (Beem Africa) kwa ajili tu ya kuwasilisha arifa za mfumo."

